01291936789025", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr8-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12331303_245598725994458_479181173273133056_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IdHUBTqgkD8Q7kNvwG2M5Iy&_nc_oc=Adpb4GM8UnizhgnqH8qSgcXQ8rc8wnG6WFxXQrls3E6bh7eXstjj62bfeI1Zu9FxRYs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr8-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5yaZCk5dRGewOhEMBCyYI3zHFYlvmmbAg5GxI_rrX4lg&oe=6A10797D"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "642658059801509", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr8-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12139433_425044671239926_4609888145117282304_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Dh8kWz9H4qEQ7kNvwHAilwf&_nc_oc=AdoZreEWeDpWmLccDaPDA44UNoHlquoMXcMLPMVNsbL9JeE4KuiItepgKfPBJgpXoS0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr8-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6IL97_T1-2dwz2Paw8J1o46OYzDIkNXtlUBKsUGTI1Bg&oe=6A105FBB"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "619740281913536", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr8-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12139467_430682997415049_6349888944162734080_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xexT9WYSGb8Q7kNvwGVTnm4&_nc_oc=AdoQ_ty_p3XZZGQm-ZJsvHbozBMPVUEWBoMEAZXA6QXGSqE7gGJ_qixR19ombAHYC6Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr8-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4hbf254kxyxjPv6WG-VQhmy37wFVK_oyUcY4aKnJMdEw&oe=6A1074E5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "RotatorX", "keywords": ["Arcade", "Endlessrunner", "SciFi", "Speed", "Fast"], "long_description": "RotatorX is an endless runner type arcade game with a dark unique sci-fi atmosphere. Fast paced and addictive - but also meditative. The intuitive controls makes it easy to play - but it's hard to gain. Speed, procedural level design, dynamic lighting FX and an adaptive soundtrack will guarantee a challenging and immersive VR experience.\n\nKEY FEATURES\n* Dynamic lighting FX\n* Adaptive soundtrack\n* Intuitve controls\n* Procedural level design\n\n! Oculus Go only !", "short_description": "RotatorX is an endless runner type arcade game with a